{
  "id": "section-spells",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-spells:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": " Spells\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,22,30]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-spells:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "In general, spells are Arcane Skills\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,30,67]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-spells:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and may be found in books or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,67,96]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-spells:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "libraries, or be taught by friendly\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,96,132]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-spells:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "witches. Some spells require a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,132,163]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-spells:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Magic roll. For example, a spell may\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,163,200]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-spells:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "require a L3 Magic roll, meaning\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,200,233]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-spells:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you must roll 3+ on d6 to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,233,259]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-spells:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "successfully perform the ritual. If\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,259,295]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-spells:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you have the Occultist Skill, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,295,329]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-spells:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have +1 to Magic rolls. If you have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,329,365]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-spells:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the Occultist Skill (Expert), roll at +2.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,365,407]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    29
  ]
}
